NODE id=matrix/construct/schema/primitives.StructureNode.UnmarshalJSON kind=method
  digest=b3:44ba602db10fcb18a6a6fc3794c4b19cb6c9682d3e026819a82465ab58387bc3 file=construct/schema/primitives/structure.go range=47:69 lang=go exported=true byte_range=1354:2239
  sig=func (n *StructureNode) UnmarshalJSON(b []byte) error
  doc=UnmarshalJSON decodes a node while COERCING every table cell value to a\nstring. The wire/render contract for cells is map[string]string, but models\nroutinely fill table cells with raw numbers or booleans (a price, a count, a\nflag) instead of strings. Rather than fail the entire render with "cannot\nunmarshal number into Go value of type string", we accept any JSON scalar and\nkeep its textual form. Children recurse through this same method.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/construct/schema/primitives.StructureNode
  ^defines=matrix/construct/schema/primitives/structure.go

